  "Die Mappe enthält Buchungen, Anlage EÜR{0}, offene Posten und Kontakte, mit echten Datums- und Eurozellen. Die Visitenkarten (vCard) lesen Outlook, Google und das Telefon.{1}": "The workbook contains transactions, Anlage EÜR{0}, open items and contacts, with real date and euro cells. The business cards (vCard) can be read by Outlook, Google and your phone.{1}",
